{#
  Why a form takes no answer (issue #925). One sentence per reason, because
  the single « fermé, il a été fermé le <date de fermeture> » it replaces
  announced a closing date months ahead as already past when the form had
  been closed by hand, and called a form not yet open closed.

  Needs: form (NewsForm), form_availability (NewsForm::availability(), a
  single reference date for the whole page). Renders nothing for an open form.
#}
{% if form_availability == 'force_closed' %}
    <div class="alert alert-secondary">
        Ce formulaire est fermé et n'accepte plus de réponses.
    </div>
{% elseif form_availability == 'not_yet_open' %}
    <div class="alert alert-secondary">
        Ce formulaire n'est pas encore ouvert.
        {% if form.opensAt %}Il ouvrira le {{ form.opensAt|french_date }}.{% endif %}
    </div>
{% elseif form_availability == 'expired' %}
    <div class="alert alert-secondary">
        Ce formulaire est fermé{% if form.closesAt %} depuis le {{ form.closesAt|french_date }}{% endif %}.
    </div>
{% endif %}
